{"3083880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Too Angry To Die", "steam_appid": 3083880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever heard of someone being 'too angry to die'?</strong></h2> <strong>Meet Gideon Rageblade</strong>, the world-renowned warrior whose unbridled rage was legendary. So legendary, in fact, that people believed his fury made him immortal. Turns out, they were wrong. <strong>Gideon just died. Oops.</strong><br><br>But death is just a minor inconvenience for someone like Gideon. Now, in the afterlife, he has a new gig. He's been hired as a lieutenant for Varkul, the Lord of Torment. His mission? Clear out the plague of rebellion from The Dead Lands. Gideon might have died, but his rage lives on. And he's still too angry to die—again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Furious Clicker Action</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083880/extras/71c5971940444021962d0eab3e9f14c1.poster.avif?t=1723352269\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083880/extras/71c5971940444021962d0eab3e9f14c1.webm?t=1723352269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083880/extras/71c5971940444021962d0eab3e9f14c1.mp4?t=1723352269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Unleash Gideon's legendary rage with every click as you obliterate endless waves of enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Enemies</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083880/extras/d4413a433e50d17241b12560c4f0b2f0.poster.avif?t=1723352269\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse